### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### 2. Login
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin@rikinode.com&password=admin123

### 3. Predicción (pega el token del login)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/predict/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN

{
  "text": "I love this product!"
}

### 4. Predicción por lote
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/predict/batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PEGA_AQUI_EL_TOKEN

{
  "texts": ["Amazing quality", "Terrible service"]
}

### 5. Métricas
GET http://localhost:8000/metrics